WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 5=

01:54.980 --> 01:56.130
Your Highness, your uncle is here.

01:56.540 --> 01:57.210
He's waiting in the main hall.

02:01.290 --> 02:02.490
I only returned yesterday.

02:03.620 --> 02:04.980
Word certainly travels fast to him.

02:18.130 --> 02:18.660
Your Highness.

02:19.820 --> 02:20.450
Don't make things worse.

02:28.010 --> 02:29.890
Just think of my niece's standing.

02:31.060 --> 02:32.290
You're my protege.

02:33.130 --> 02:34.450
If you two marry,

02:34.610 --> 02:36.010
we'll be family twice over.

02:37.290 --> 02:38.010
And then,

02:38.820 --> 02:40.570
once she bears you a child...

02:44.130 --> 02:46.010
(Princess Danyang arrives!)

02:52.260 --> 02:53.570
Uncle!

02:54.500 --> 02:56.940
I had a little too much to drink
at Cuiyun Tower last night.

02:57.450 --> 02:58.980
I slept in this morning.

03:00.100 --> 03:01.410
Sorry to keep you waiting, Uncle.

03:01.500 --> 03:02.290
Danyang.

03:03.290 --> 03:05.170
(Li Zhi, Rites Ministry's Vice Director)
You're not getting any younger.

03:10.450 --> 03:12.690
And who might this handsome
young gentleman be?

03:13.170 --> 03:14.780
What a fine-looking young man.

03:15.980 --> 03:17.220
You've brought him all this way, Uncle.

03:17.380 --> 03:18.500
Aren't you going to introduce us?

03:22.780 --> 03:23.890
(That old scumbag!)

03:24.500 --> 03:26.100
(He keeps parading men through
my residence like merchandise,)

03:26.150 --> 03:26.890
(expecting me to choose one.)

03:27.220 --> 03:28.470
(Now he's even bringing me boys)

03:28.520 --> 03:29.410
(this young?)

03:31.820 --> 03:32.690
I am Wei Shu.

03:33.260 --> 03:34.260
My respects, Princess Danyang.

03:34.940 --> 03:36.540
You're from the Wei clan of Jingzhao?

03:37.100 --> 03:37.730
Yes, he is.

03:39.660 --> 03:41.010
(Wei Shu, Member of the Wei Clan Branch)
(So this is Princess Danyang.)

03:42.170 --> 03:43.610
(She's remarkably uninhibited.)

03:45.570 --> 03:46.170
Chunhua.

03:47.820 --> 03:49.820
Show this young man around my study.

03:51.290 --> 03:52.940
I need a word with my uncle.

03:53.450 --> 03:53.850
Yes.

03:59.100 --> 03:59.690
Sir,

04:00.290 --> 04:00.780
this way, please.

04:11.940 --> 04:12.610
Uncle.

04:13.130 --> 04:15.570
There are quite a few members
of the Wei clan at court these days.

04:16.290 --> 04:17.140
I hear

04:17.540 --> 04:19.100
that brilliant adviser of Lord Yu's

04:19.250 --> 04:20.290
belongs to the Wei clan too.

04:21.850 --> 04:24.580
How come I've never heard

04:24.980 --> 04:26.220
of this young man, then?

04:26.610 --> 04:28.370
Wei Qiao, Lord Yu's adviser,

04:29.050 --> 04:30.020
is his older clansman.

04:30.900 --> 04:33.170
Wei Shu comes from a cadet branch
of the clan.

04:33.660 --> 04:34.580
But despite his lesser lineage,

04:35.220 --> 04:37.170
he's one of my finest students.

04:39.780 --> 04:42.220
Every suitor you bring me, Uncle,

04:42.930 --> 04:44.700
just happens to be your student.

04:45.660 --> 04:46.460
And now,

04:46.900 --> 04:48.290
you're even bringing me someone
from a cadet branch?

04:48.580 --> 04:49.370
What do you know?

04:49.780 --> 04:51.340
Sheng'an has no shortage of talent,

04:52.540 --> 04:56.410
but a young genius like Wei Shu
is one of a kind.

04:56.930 --> 04:58.050
With his abilities,

04:58.250 --> 05:00.140
he's certain to place
among the top three this year.

05:02.140 --> 05:03.170
Top three?

05:03.540 --> 05:04.900
He hasn't even taken the exam yet.

05:05.700 --> 05:06.610
Danyang,

05:07.170 --> 05:09.220
you must stop behaving so recklessly.

05:10.290 --> 05:11.290
You're a princess.

05:11.930 --> 05:14.100
The Mu royal family's reputation
rests on your shoulders,

05:14.700 --> 05:17.220
as does the honor of our Li family.

05:18.850 --> 05:20.490
Now that your mother is gone,

05:21.290 --> 05:21.850
the Li family

05:22.370 --> 05:23.020
has no one but me

05:23.370 --> 05:24.540
and you to depend on.

05:24.930 --> 05:26.460
If you keep standing by,

05:26.700 --> 05:29.250
how can you face your late mother?

05:33.410 --> 05:34.580
You're absolutely right, Uncle.

05:34.850 --> 05:36.170
You must trust me.

05:36.930 --> 05:38.700
Once Wei Shu passes the imperial exams

05:39.250 --> 05:40.100
and secures an official post,

05:40.660 --> 05:41.660
he'll have no connections of his own.

05:42.250 --> 05:43.490
He'll have to rely on the Li family.

05:44.170 --> 05:46.220
That'll make him easy for us to control.

05:46.610 --> 05:47.460
He would be

05:47.900 --> 05:49.700
the perfect choice for your husband.

05:52.930 --> 05:53.900
I understand now.

05:54.220 --> 05:54.730
Uncle.

05:55.250 --> 05:55.980
You may leave now.

05:56.930 --> 05:58.980
Let that young man stay at my residence.

05:59.490 --> 06:01.020
I'll spend some time talking to him

06:01.540 --> 06:02.370
and getting to know him better.

06:03.460 --> 06:03.930
Good.

06:04.810 --> 06:05.370
Excellent!

06:06.980 --> 06:08.900
If Wei Shu wins your favor,

06:09.490 --> 06:10.730
use your personal recommendation

06:10.930 --> 06:12.700
to get him into the Imperial Academy.

06:13.290 --> 06:15.050
It's worth a thousand submitted essays!

06:15.810 --> 06:17.410
He already comes from a noble clan.

06:18.050 --> 06:20.340
With honors from the exams
and a princess for a wife,

06:20.460 --> 06:21.460
his standing will only improve.

06:22.020 --> 06:23.580
He'll be a worthy match for you.

06:26.730 --> 06:28.580
Chunhua, tell me.

06:28.900 --> 06:30.850
Why is everyone so desperate
to get into the Imperial Academy?

06:31.700 --> 06:32.340
Who?

06:40.250 --> 06:42.370
(So he's a little bookworm.)

06:52.020 --> 06:52.410
Your Highness.

06:55.930 --> 06:57.250
Apart from your studies,

06:57.700 --> 06:58.410
what else are you good at?

07:00.460 --> 07:01.460
Beyond books and poetry,

07:01.810 --> 07:02.490
I have no other talents.

07:03.930 --> 07:06.170
Everyone has something they enjoy.

07:07.370 --> 07:08.610
I don't believe you have no hobbies.

07:09.170 --> 07:10.050
And if you say you don't,

07:10.290 --> 07:11.170
then you're lying to me.

07:13.580 --> 07:13.900
I...

07:14.490 --> 07:15.700
I enjoy studying alchemy
in my spare time.

07:17.730 --> 07:18.580
Then why don't you

07:18.700 --> 07:21.610
make me an elixir of immortality?

07:22.810 --> 07:24.100
Once you've made it,

07:24.490 --> 07:25.730
I'll reward you by making you
my husband.

07:27.250 --> 07:28.460
You've misunderstood, Your Highness.

07:29.170 --> 07:30.980
Alchemy isn't some mystical sorcery.

07:31.700 --> 07:32.810
It can't make people immortal.

07:33.220 --> 07:34.050
Really?

07:36.220 --> 07:36.980
Why not?

07:38.730 --> 07:39.140
People...

07:39.900 --> 07:41.410
Everyone... Everyone dies eventually.

07:42.540 --> 07:44.020
Don't you want to marry a princess?

07:44.810 --> 07:47.460
Instead of saying something sweet
to please me,

07:48.340 --> 07:51.050
you insist on telling me
such grim truths.

07:54.700 --> 07:56.780
My mentor arranged this marriage.

07:57.810 --> 07:58.730
It's not what I want.

07:59.540 --> 08:00.810
I never wanted to take this path.

08:02.140 --> 08:02.700
That's all I have to say.

08:03.170 --> 08:03.980
I accept whatever punishment
you see fit.

08:07.490 --> 08:08.540
Why do you keep avoiding me?

08:09.610 --> 08:10.730
What am I going to do, eat you alive?

08:11.980 --> 08:12.660
Do I look

08:12.900 --> 08:15.250
like some wicked woman who forces
handsome young men into her bed?

08:20.900 --> 08:21.810
Don't worry.

08:22.540 --> 08:23.660
As for my uncle's arrangements,

08:24.490 --> 08:25.490
I'll take care of everything.

08:26.370 --> 08:27.490
Go to the Imperial Academy tomorrow.

08:28.140 --> 08:30.140
Just say you're under my patronage,
and they'll admit you.

08:31.810 --> 08:34.060
As for tonight...

08:36.940 --> 08:39.300
Why don't you spend the night here
with me?

08:57.730 --> 08:58.180
Your Highness.

08:59.060 --> 09:00.730
Can we really trust Princess Danyang?

09:01.340 --> 09:03.460
Whether she truly intends
to help me or not,

09:04.010 --> 09:05.420
her hatred for Yu Cheng'an

09:06.420 --> 09:07.300
is certainly genuine.

09:07.980 --> 09:08.580
Back then,

09:09.610 --> 09:10.770
it was Yu Cheng'an

09:11.460 --> 09:12.610
who arranged her marriage to North Jing.

09:14.220 --> 09:15.030
I've heard that over the years,

09:15.080 --> 09:16.490
she suffered terrible abuse there.

09:17.130 --> 09:18.580
Had Meng Baiyu not died so suddenly,

09:19.730 --> 09:21.610
she might have spent the rest of her
life rotting away in North Jing.

09:23.370 --> 09:24.770
And when she finally returned,

09:26.130 --> 09:27.180
the Empress had already died.

09:28.530 --> 09:29.250
Mother and daughter

09:30.220 --> 09:31.730
never even got to say goodbye.

09:33.530 --> 09:35.700
Once the cherished princess
and blessing of Huai Dynasty,

09:36.100 --> 09:37.030
she's now become

09:37.080 --> 09:38.850
a disgraced, fallen woman.

09:40.010 --> 09:41.180
Her hatred for Yu Cheng'an

09:43.010 --> 09:44.060
must be genuine.

09:46.340 --> 09:47.650
I just wonder...

09:48.770 --> 09:49.890
After just one journey,

09:51.490 --> 09:52.700
where did she find the courage

09:53.730 --> 09:55.060
to take on such overwhelming odds?

09:55.650 --> 09:57.580
I've heard rumors among
the common people

09:58.820 --> 10:00.460
that Princess Danyang's child

10:01.010 --> 10:03.010
is destined to rule the realm
and establish a new dynasty.

10:03.700 --> 10:04.580
Utter nonsense.

10:05.580 --> 10:06.530
Only fools would believe that.

10:08.940 --> 10:09.490
Your Highness,

10:10.010 --> 10:11.270
Princess Danyang has invited
Li Zhi's student

10:11.320 --> 10:12.010
to stay at her residence.

10:20.700 --> 10:21.770
It seems it's time

10:22.940 --> 10:24.890
to recall Yang Si from the army.

10:38.820 --> 10:39.460
(Mu Wanyao.)

10:40.580 --> 10:41.580
(You must gain power.)

10:42.730 --> 10:43.770
(You need to find allies.)

10:44.980 --> 10:47.060
(Only then will you stand a chance
against the "tiger".)

10:49.220 --> 10:50.250
(This city)

10:52.100 --> 10:53.060
(is your prison)

10:54.770 --> 10:55.770
(and your battlefield.)

10:57.890 --> 10:58.820
(Yet all you have around you)

10:59.530 --> 11:01.300
(are allies who don't trust you,)

11:02.460 --> 11:04.010
(a family consumed by greed,)

11:05.420 --> 11:07.010
(and aging, ailing loved ones.)

11:10.940 --> 11:11.530
(Mu Wanyao.)

11:13.130 --> 11:13.850
(What will you do?)

11:23.940 --> 11:28.340
(Mingde Gate)

11:30.980 --> 11:31.850
Sheng'an.

11:33.340 --> 11:34.180
It's been a long time.

11:40.890 --> 11:43.130
(This batch should fetch
a few extra coins!)

11:43.530 --> 11:44.250
(Such fine goods!)

11:45.980 --> 11:46.850
(I could charge even more!)

11:54.130 --> 11:55.100
(Come take a look!)

11:55.250 --> 11:56.010
(Greens for sale!)

11:57.730 --> 11:59.130
(Fresh greens!)

12:03.300 --> 12:04.300
(Flowers for sale!)

12:04.650 --> 12:05.730
(Make way! Coming through!)

12:07.650 --> 12:08.820
(Fresh goods!)

12:15.460 --> 12:16.960
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

12:16.960 --> 12:23.560
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

12:33.180 --> 12:36.180
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

12:45.800 --> 12:47.960
(To Princess Danyang
Respectfully, Yan Shang)

12:50.320 --> 12:56.660
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

12:59.460 --> 13:03.540
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

13:04.010 --> 13:05.940
(Hot steamed buns!)

13:06.850 --> 13:09.300
(Freshly steamed buns!)

13:11.610 --> 13:12.220
Yan Shang?

13:15.130 --> 13:15.820
Wenji!

13:18.460 --> 13:19.890
It really is you!

13:24.700 --> 13:26.180
I thought my eyes were playing tricks
on me.

13:27.100 --> 13:28.220
What are you doing here?

13:29.650 --> 13:30.370
It's a long story.

13:31.100 --> 13:31.850
I've been traveling for two days.

13:32.580 --> 13:33.490
Let me get settled first.

13:35.100 --> 13:36.250
You've already found a place to stay?

13:36.490 --> 13:36.850
Where?

13:38.250 --> 13:39.850
There's a temple called Yongshou
up ahead.

13:40.180 --> 13:41.220
I'm not sure if it's still there.

13:41.650 --> 13:42.820
I was hoping to stay there.

13:44.890 --> 13:46.010
Yongshou Temple?

13:46.890 --> 13:47.530
Brilliant!

13:48.010 --> 13:48.940
That's just like you!

13:49.460 --> 13:50.250
Of course it's still there.

13:52.250 --> 13:53.220
How do you know about Yongshou Temple?

13:54.460 --> 13:55.340
I just asked around.

13:57.460 --> 13:59.300
(Cuiyun Tower)
I rented a private room at Cuiyun Tower.

13:59.530 --> 14:00.610
The furnishings are luxurious,

14:01.060 --> 14:02.220
but it's noisy all day.

14:02.490 --> 14:03.370
I can barely concentrate on my studies.

14:04.460 --> 14:05.610
It's been driving me crazy.

14:06.370 --> 14:07.180
But the temple is peaceful

14:07.420 --> 14:08.060
and has plenty of books.

14:08.890 --> 14:10.180
Countless scholars

14:10.370 --> 14:11.460
stay there to prepare for the exams.

14:12.060 --> 14:12.420
I'd say

14:12.770 --> 14:14.650
it's a hundred times better
than Cuiyun Tower!

14:15.850 --> 14:16.610
And here's another advantage.

14:17.580 --> 14:18.490
It's cheap!

14:20.490 --> 14:20.980
Wait here!

14:20.980 --> 14:22.960
(Cuiyun Tower)

14:23.730 --> 14:24.980
I'll go pack my things

14:25.220 --> 14:26.940
and move to Yongshou Temple with you!

14:28.700 --> 14:30.010
You'd better tell me everything

14:30.180 --> 14:31.700
about what happened

14:31.980 --> 14:33.530
(Cuiyun Tower)
and how you ended up in Sheng'an!

14:34.940 --> 14:35.250
All right.

14:35.940 --> 14:36.420
I'll wait here.

14:44.340 --> 14:45.220
Wei Shu.

14:46.130 --> 14:47.490
You're so good at studying.

14:47.820 --> 14:50.010
Why are you so slow
at learning backgammon?

14:50.650 --> 14:51.060
Your Highness,

14:51.940 --> 14:52.820
I've never

14:53.250 --> 14:54.370
played this game before.

14:54.940 --> 14:56.300
What a shame!

14:56.730 --> 14:57.610
It's so much fun.

14:58.420 --> 14:59.220
Let's play another round.

14:59.610 --> 15:00.650
You'll get the hang of it soon.

15:04.220 --> 15:05.300
How am I doing as your teacher?

15:09.460 --> 15:10.010
Your Highness,

15:10.730 --> 15:11.460
you're an excellent teacher.

15:13.340 --> 15:15.650
This is how my mother used to teach me.

15:17.060 --> 15:17.580
Let's continue.

15:58.630 --> 15:59.440
Oh, my!

16:00.820 --> 16:01.890
You won.

16:04.700 --> 16:05.340
Chunhua.

16:20.250 --> 16:20.700
Your Highness.

16:32.770 --> 16:33.850
This cloak

16:34.300 --> 16:35.490
is your prize for winning.

16:36.580 --> 16:37.250
Tomorrow,

16:38.130 --> 16:39.300
wear it when you go out.

16:43.490 --> 16:44.530
I'm tired. No more games.

17:01.060 --> 17:03.400
(Yongshou Temple)

17:05.010 --> 17:05.860
She gave me a ride.

17:06.290 --> 17:07.290
I got off outside the city

17:07.530 --> 17:08.220
and walked for another two days.

17:08.700 --> 17:09.380
Who would've thought

17:09.730 --> 17:11.180
I'd run into you as soon
as I entered the city?

17:18.620 --> 17:19.940
Which lucky lady is this for?

17:26.810 --> 17:27.660
I've been meaning to ask you.

17:28.090 --> 17:30.050
That guest of yours
was Princess Danyang!

17:30.530 --> 17:31.620
Why didn't you tell me back then?

17:34.570 --> 17:35.770
I was already in enough trouble.

17:36.140 --> 17:37.420
I couldn't drag you into it too.

17:39.050 --> 17:39.460
Fair enough.

17:40.180 --> 17:40.980
It was a serious matter.

17:41.570 --> 17:42.380
If I were you,

17:42.770 --> 17:43.810
I'd have kept my mouth shut too.

17:45.700 --> 17:48.490
A princess of such noble birth...

17:49.250 --> 17:50.660
If anything had happened to her
in the countryside,

17:51.220 --> 17:52.140
who could've answered for it?

17:52.900 --> 17:54.180
If she were truly so blessed,

17:54.700 --> 17:56.290
why would she have been sent
to that desolate land

17:56.770 --> 17:57.730
to marry a traitor?

17:59.530 --> 18:01.490
Well, she was born under
an auspicious omen.

18:02.090 --> 18:02.900
With a birth like hers,

18:04.460 --> 18:06.420
it's hard to say whether she's blessed
or cursed.

18:17.010 --> 18:17.290
Shang.

18:19.420 --> 18:20.980
So, Miss Chunhua...

18:22.090 --> 18:23.460
She really is Princess Danyang's maid?

18:23.900 --> 18:24.220
Yes.

18:27.010 --> 18:28.090
Why do you ask?

18:31.250 --> 18:31.530
No...

18:32.010 --> 18:32.460
No reason.

18:35.530 --> 18:36.010
Wenji.

18:36.770 --> 18:37.620
You're good at everything,

18:38.050 --> 18:38.980
except lying.

18:40.380 --> 18:40.700
Come on!

18:41.140 --> 18:42.770
There's really nothing between us!

18:43.420 --> 18:43.700
We...

18:43.900 --> 18:45.090
We barely know each other!

18:45.330 --> 18:47.900
Yet you can't get her off your mind.

18:51.330 --> 18:52.250
I'm not discussing this with you.

19:01.730 --> 19:02.050
Shang.

19:02.900 --> 19:03.460
You know,

19:03.770 --> 19:05.090
you really are one lucky fellow.

19:05.700 --> 19:07.570
You pulled off something incredible
without saying a word.

19:11.330 --> 19:12.180
Even my father

19:12.730 --> 19:14.330
couldn't get me into
the Imperial Academy.

19:15.860 --> 19:17.420
Yet you managed it through the princess!

19:18.010 --> 19:19.770
It was only a verbal promise.

19:20.330 --> 19:21.250
I don't even have anything in writing.

19:22.290 --> 19:23.250
Getting into the Imperial Academy

19:23.730 --> 19:24.900
may still take some effort.

19:26.140 --> 19:27.220
Well, you two know each other now.

19:27.900 --> 19:29.220
You can always ask her again

19:29.490 --> 19:30.490
to write you a letter of recommendation.

19:32.460 --> 19:34.290
At least you can visit Chunhua
at the princess's residence.

19:34.900 --> 19:35.900
I wouldn't dare face her.

19:37.730 --> 19:38.180
Why not?

19:40.980 --> 19:41.860
I offended her.

19:42.620 --> 19:44.770
If I showed up, she'd probably
beat me up.

19:55.530 --> 19:57.380
Young men, one after another...

19:59.180 --> 19:59.980
What are you muttering about?

20:00.900 --> 20:02.330
You've turned away every man

20:02.490 --> 20:03.770
your uncle has brought here.

20:04.380 --> 20:05.660
Why keep this one?

20:07.290 --> 20:09.330
Have you actually taken a liking to him?

20:11.330 --> 20:12.220
I have taken a liking to him.

20:17.140 --> 20:18.290
What about Yan Shang, then?

20:18.810 --> 20:19.660
Why would I want him?

20:22.570 --> 20:23.250
In the past,

20:24.050 --> 20:25.220
all the men my uncle brought here

20:26.090 --> 20:27.330
were nothing but scheming opportunists.

20:28.420 --> 20:29.290
But Wei Shu

20:30.140 --> 20:30.810
is different.

20:32.290 --> 20:33.050
I'm keeping him around.

20:33.250 --> 20:34.250
He'll prove useful someday.

20:37.730 --> 20:39.140
If the gossips in the capital find out,

20:39.290 --> 20:40.180
they'll never stop talking.

20:41.980 --> 20:43.490
Do you think I'm afraid of gossip?

20:44.530 --> 20:45.660
Surely you don't think

20:46.010 --> 20:47.860
I have a good reputation to protect?

20:48.730 --> 20:49.290
But...

20:49.810 --> 20:50.940
No more buts, Chunhua.

20:52.140 --> 20:53.010
From now on,

20:53.420 --> 20:54.330
everything will be different.

20:56.010 --> 20:56.980
This residence

20:57.700 --> 20:58.700
will soon be filled with more
and more people.

21:09.860 --> 21:10.980
This fine wine from the Western Regions

21:11.770 --> 21:14.220
somehow doesn't taste as good
as that cheap wine from Lingnan.

21:14.770 --> 21:15.140
Your Highness,

21:15.530 --> 21:17.770
shall I send someone to Lingnan
to buy more?

21:18.420 --> 21:18.980
No need.

21:19.810 --> 21:20.900
Perhaps it's just my imagination.

21:22.250 --> 21:22.940
Once I taste it again,

21:24.330 --> 21:25.380
I might find it's nothing special.

21:27.730 --> 21:28.290
Oh, Your Highness,

21:29.220 --> 21:30.250
Yan Shang has written you a letter.

21:30.570 --> 21:31.530
(To Princess Danyang; Yan Shang)
The gatekeeper received it today.

21:33.860 --> 21:34.700
I don't have time to read it.

21:35.530 --> 21:37.730
And stop accepting every little thing
sent to my residence.

21:58.220 --> 22:00.620
Shang, don't underestimate

22:00.810 --> 22:01.860
the imperial exams.

22:02.050 --> 22:03.940
It takes more than studying
and intelligence.

22:05.660 --> 22:06.460
These past few days,

22:07.050 --> 22:08.090
I've come to realize something.

22:09.980 --> 22:11.140
Sheng'an is full

22:11.250 --> 22:12.380
of brilliant scholars

22:12.730 --> 22:13.570
and powerful nobles.

22:14.380 --> 22:16.290
All those scholars hoping
to enter officialdom

22:16.660 --> 22:18.250
spend day and night seeking patronage.

22:19.420 --> 22:22.050
They compile and copy their poems
and essays,

22:22.490 --> 22:24.980
then submit them to influential families
to gain favor.

22:26.220 --> 22:26.660
As the saying goes,

22:27.290 --> 22:28.940
"By morning, feast with the mighty.

22:29.530 --> 22:31.570
By dusk, wander the dusty streets."

22:33.460 --> 22:34.980
If you manage to impress
a powerful patron,

22:36.050 --> 22:38.530
your chances in the exams
improve enormously.

22:40.620 --> 22:41.290
You see,

22:42.330 --> 22:43.250
the higher your social standing,

22:43.860 --> 22:45.490
the better your chances of passing.

22:47.090 --> 22:49.220
The most powerful man in Sheng'an

22:49.940 --> 22:51.570
must be Lord Yu, Yu Cheng'an, right?

22:53.090 --> 22:53.460
Exactly.

22:55.010 --> 22:55.700
All these years,

22:56.180 --> 22:58.700
those imperial court reports
I showed you weren't wasted!

23:00.900 --> 23:02.860
The Rebellion of the Seven Garrisons
was crushed

23:03.250 --> 23:04.380
by the Shence Army.

23:04.810 --> 23:05.530
And that army

23:05.980 --> 23:07.330
was commanded by Yu Cheng'an himself.

23:08.010 --> 23:09.620
After the rebellion was suppressed,

23:09.940 --> 23:11.980
Yu Cheng'an retained command
of a vast army

23:13.250 --> 23:15.420
and was named General of Cavalry
and Duke of Zhao.

23:15.900 --> 23:17.860
He can even enter court armed,
wielding unrivaled power.

23:22.860 --> 23:23.730
In private,

23:24.250 --> 23:25.530
people call him the emperor
behind the throne.

23:26.770 --> 23:28.380
Even the man on the throne

23:29.770 --> 23:30.700
probably has to yield to him.

23:35.570 --> 23:37.220
If he's really that powerful,

23:38.180 --> 23:39.700
then seeking his patronage
would be hopeless.

23:40.620 --> 23:41.460
Never mind ordinary scholars.

23:41.980 --> 23:43.380
Even officials in Sheng'an

23:43.770 --> 23:44.810
who serve at the same court

23:45.730 --> 23:47.620
must find him utterly
beyond their reach.

23:51.530 --> 23:52.140
You're right.

23:56.660 --> 23:57.620
So, Wenji,

23:58.460 --> 23:59.460
whose patronage will you seek?

24:00.770 --> 24:02.140
I'm a man of honor!

24:02.380 --> 24:04.490
Flattering and groveling
before the powerful?

24:04.660 --> 24:05.730
I'd never stoop so low!

24:06.900 --> 24:09.220
Let alone associate with those eunuchs!

24:20.980 --> 24:21.330
Shang.

24:24.730 --> 24:25.050
I...

24:26.250 --> 24:27.980
I wasn't accusing you of using
Princess Danyang to get ahead.

24:32.420 --> 24:33.140
We're friends.

24:33.900 --> 24:34.570
There's no need to explain.

24:38.380 --> 24:39.010
All right, Shang.

24:39.570 --> 24:41.090
You've spent all day unpacking.

24:41.290 --> 24:41.860
Get some rest.

24:43.250 --> 24:44.660
I've been hauling luggage
all day myself.

24:44.810 --> 24:45.490
I'm exhausted.

24:51.380 --> 24:52.090
(But Wenji,)

24:53.290 --> 24:55.900
(Lord Yu now controls
the entire imperial court.)

24:56.940 --> 24:58.010
(If you want to enter officialdom,)

24:59.140 --> 25:01.140
(how can you possibly
keep your hands clean?)

25:25.500 --> 25:28.640
(Imperial Academy)

25:28.700 --> 25:29.250
(Take care!)

25:36.770 --> 25:37.110
(Thank you.)

25:37.160 --> 25:37.940
(Mr. Wang! Come here!)

25:38.530 --> 25:39.290
(Let's go!)

25:39.980 --> 25:40.350
(Morning, Mr. Li!)

25:40.400 --> 25:41.010
(Come on, let's go together.)

25:41.180 --> 25:41.430
(Let's go.)

25:41.480 --> 25:41.720
(Sure.)

25:41.770 --> 25:42.860
(Fresh greens!)

25:43.700 --> 25:44.290
(Come again!)

25:44.290 --> 25:45.420
(Gathering Auspice)

25:45.420 --> 25:45.860
Stop right there!

25:47.090 --> 25:48.090
Who are you?

25:48.810 --> 25:50.940
Why haven't I seen you
at the Imperial Academy before?

25:54.140 --> 25:54.490
Sir.

25:55.940 --> 25:57.700
Princess Danyang recommended me
for admission.

25:58.250 --> 25:58.730
Young man,

25:59.330 --> 26:00.940
do you have proof of your rank
and family background?

26:01.490 --> 26:02.730
And your registration papers?

26:03.530 --> 26:04.010
No.

26:04.660 --> 26:06.050
Princess Danyang has vouched for me.

26:07.140 --> 26:07.940
If you don't believe me,

26:08.490 --> 26:09.620
you may verify it at her residence.

26:10.660 --> 26:12.090
The princess's residence
sent word yesterday

26:12.250 --> 26:14.530
that she'd recommend a young man
from a noble family.

26:15.250 --> 26:16.980
This must be him.

26:17.380 --> 26:18.250
(A young man from a noble family?)

26:20.050 --> 26:20.860
A misunderstanding!

26:21.090 --> 26:21.670
(Imperial Academy; Gathering Auspice)
Just a misunderstanding.

26:21.720 --> 26:22.380
Please follow me.

26:27.330 --> 26:27.770
Stop!

26:29.570 --> 26:32.010
I don't believe I've seen you before,
young man.

26:32.420 --> 26:34.350
What brings you here?

26:34.400 --> 26:34.770
I...

26:35.620 --> 26:36.900
I'm here to enroll
at the Imperial Academy.

26:38.010 --> 26:38.700
Enroll?

26:40.090 --> 26:41.330
(That's Mu Wanyao's cloak.)

26:42.420 --> 26:43.050
(Then he must be)

26:43.900 --> 26:44.670
(the young nobleman)

26:44.720 --> 26:46.860
(who's truly won the princess's favor.)

26:47.290 --> 26:48.330
Who recommended you?

26:48.730 --> 26:49.530
Do you have proof?

26:51.620 --> 26:52.460
I... Princess...

26:53.940 --> 26:54.220
Her...

26:57.380 --> 26:59.250
Who exactly recommended you?

26:59.620 --> 27:01.110
Why is it so hard to say?

27:01.160 --> 27:01.460
I...

27:07.220 --> 27:07.570
Sir.

27:08.490 --> 27:09.940
This young gentleman, like me,

27:10.530 --> 27:11.810
was also recommended
by Princess Danyang.

27:13.810 --> 27:15.660
Her residence never mentioned
two people.

27:16.050 --> 27:17.250
Why would there be two?

27:20.050 --> 27:22.010
Because Her Highness is generous
with her affections.

27:22.290 --> 27:23.770
If you find that scandalous,

27:24.380 --> 27:25.770
you're welcome to take it up with her.

27:26.620 --> 27:26.940
Well...

27:32.770 --> 27:35.330
(Imperial Academy; Gathering Auspice)
Follow me to complete your enrollment.

27:38.010 --> 27:38.730
(Wang! Over here!)

27:39.010 --> 27:39.380
(Over here!)

27:39.570 --> 27:40.570
(Mr. Li! Stop him!)

27:41.220 --> 27:41.500
(This way!)

27:41.550 --> 27:42.140
About earlier...

27:42.900 --> 27:43.460
Thank you.

27:44.380 --> 27:44.810
You're welcome.

27:45.490 --> 27:46.490
Actually, I should be thanking you.

27:47.250 --> 27:47.900
To tell you the truth,

27:48.570 --> 27:50.290
without using your connection
to the princess,

27:51.050 --> 27:52.250
I'd never have gotten
into the Imperial Academy.

27:55.620 --> 27:56.290
Wei Shu, wait!

28:02.380 --> 28:02.810
Yan Shang.

28:03.620 --> 28:04.660
Though I belong to the Wei clan,

28:05.380 --> 28:06.530
I'm only a concubine's son
from a lesser branch.

28:07.620 --> 28:08.570
But I'm not the princess's...

28:10.220 --> 28:10.730
Her...

28:13.010 --> 28:13.660
Male favorite?

28:14.940 --> 28:15.460
I'm not!

28:17.980 --> 28:18.620
Neither are you?

28:20.050 --> 28:20.530
Neither?

28:23.660 --> 28:24.180
Anyway,

28:24.980 --> 28:26.140
even if you befriend me,

28:26.570 --> 28:27.570
I can't do much for you.

28:30.570 --> 28:31.010
Wei Shu,

28:33.860 --> 28:34.330
you're overthinking it.

28:35.660 --> 28:36.770
I'm from Lingnan.

28:37.330 --> 28:38.420
My family makes a living farming.

28:39.380 --> 28:40.180
Would you be willing

28:40.700 --> 28:42.490
to be friends with a humble country boy
like me?

28:48.250 --> 28:48.730
Yan Shang.

28:49.700 --> 28:50.460
I'm ashamed of myself.

28:51.250 --> 28:52.620
I judged you by my own petty standards.

28:58.980 --> 28:59.380
Come on.

29:00.090 --> 29:00.860
Let's look around outside.

29:01.900 --> 29:02.700
I'm new to Sheng'an,

29:03.090 --> 29:03.860
so I'll need you, Wei Shu,

29:04.460 --> 29:05.490
to show me around.

29:06.420 --> 29:06.810
Of course.

29:07.380 --> 29:07.700
Sure.

29:08.460 --> 29:08.730
Let's go.

29:12.250 --> 29:13.630
(Stop teasing us! Come on!)

29:13.680 --> 29:14.430
(Just show us already!)

29:14.480 --> 29:15.250
- Gentlemen!
- (Let us see!)

29:15.380 --> 29:16.530
- Please, be patient.
- (What's so special about it?)

29:16.980 --> 29:18.490
Today, I spent a fortune

29:19.180 --> 29:20.460
to acquire this inkstone.

29:21.140 --> 29:21.540
Let us see it.

29:21.590 --> 29:22.770
I'm afraid I can't show it to you.

29:23.380 --> 29:24.490
This inkstone is priceless.

29:24.700 --> 29:25.570
It can't be shown to just anyone.

29:25.980 --> 29:26.900
At noon today,

29:27.290 --> 29:28.620
at Cuiyun Tower in Pingkang Ward,

29:29.250 --> 29:30.940
I'll unveil the inkstone for all to see.

29:31.330 --> 29:32.010
I invite you all

29:32.620 --> 29:33.460
to feast your eyes on it!

29:34.620 --> 29:35.460
(Tea Aromas Abound; Wenyan Studio)
(All right! All right!)

29:35.510 --> 29:35.950
(I'll definitely be there!)

29:36.000 --> 29:36.460
(It's a deal!)

29:36.510 --> 29:38.330
We'll certainly come and see it!

29:39.380 --> 29:41.290
(I don't believe it.
What's so special about an inkstone?)

29:43.180 --> 29:43.460
(Right!)

29:43.860 --> 29:44.910
(Let's see if this treasure
is the real deal!)

29:44.960 --> 29:45.460
Yan Shang.

29:46.250 --> 29:47.570
Cuiyun Tower in Pingkang Ward

29:47.900 --> 29:49.290
(Tea Aromas Abound; Wenyan Studio)
is where the capital's rich

29:49.460 --> 29:50.570
and powerful gather
to spend money like water.

29:53.140 --> 29:54.940
Cuiyun Tower in Pingkang Ward...

29:56.140 --> 29:56.490
Wei Shu,

29:57.140 --> 29:58.570
let's go see this treasure
for ourselves.

29:59.530 --> 30:00.220
I think I'll...

30:00.980 --> 30:01.460
pass.

30:01.530 --> 30:02.590
(Unveil it! Unveil it!)

30:02.640 --> 30:03.020
Excuse me.

30:03.070 --> 30:09.070
(Unveil it! Unveil it! Unveil it!)

30:09.070 --> 30:15.880
(Unveil it! Unveil it! Unveil it!)

30:22.660 --> 30:23.900
(There's nothing special about it.)

30:24.980 --> 30:25.670
(That's supposed to be a treasure?)

30:25.720 --> 30:26.630
(Feng Xianyu, Imperial Exam Candidate)
My name is Feng Xianyu.

30:26.680 --> 30:27.380
(Did we get tricked?)

30:28.250 --> 30:29.570
I've studied tirelessly for ten years,

30:30.180 --> 30:31.140
devouring countless books.

30:31.530 --> 30:33.810
Yet I've had no chance
to fulfill my ambitions.

30:35.140 --> 30:36.570
Just like this inkstone,

30:37.250 --> 30:38.140
I'm buried in obscurity,

30:38.730 --> 30:39.460
unnoticed by anyone.

30:43.050 --> 30:44.630
(That cost a thousand qian!)

30:44.680 --> 30:45.330
(And he just smashed it!)

30:45.660 --> 30:46.570
A mere stone.

30:47.380 --> 30:49.010
All it takes is some empty praise

30:49.570 --> 30:51.010
to draw crowds from across the city.

30:51.620 --> 30:52.460
Yet I, Feng Xianyu,

30:53.700 --> 30:55.090
am worth less than a worthless rock!

31:01.420 --> 31:01.940
Excuse me.

31:04.140 --> 31:05.770
Feng Xianyu, did you invite us here

31:06.460 --> 31:08.530
just to watch you smash an inkstone?

31:09.290 --> 31:09.620
No.

31:10.530 --> 31:12.290
I wanted everyone to read my writing.

31:13.860 --> 31:15.090
This so-called treasure may be a fake,

31:16.050 --> 31:17.460
but my gift for poetry

31:18.290 --> 31:19.140
is the real thing!

31:22.020 --> 31:25.260
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed,
it hums with the river's endless roar.)

31:31.860 --> 31:34.700
How many autumns have I spent a stranger
in Sheng'an?

31:37.420 --> 31:40.490
In autumn winds, I ride alone
and climb the tower.

31:41.460 --> 31:44.050
My sword remains untested,
its spirit sheathed,

31:48.530 --> 31:52.330
yet flows with the river's roar,
day and night.

31:59.460 --> 32:00.170
What a wonderful poem!

32:00.220 --> 32:00.730
(Brilliant poetry!)

32:01.090 --> 32:01.700
(Beautifully written!)

32:01.750 --> 32:02.540
- Excellent poem!
- (Wonderful!)

32:02.590 --> 32:03.620
(Especially that line!)

32:04.180 --> 32:04.660
(Bravo!)

32:04.860 --> 32:05.330
(Marvelous!)

32:06.490 --> 32:07.420
(Outstanding!)

32:08.240 --> 32:11.620
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed,
it hums with the river's endless roar.)

32:13.010 --> 32:13.900
(What a brilliant poem!)

32:14.180 --> 32:15.150
(Yes! That's him!)

32:15.200 --> 32:16.110
- (What a remarkable young talent!)
- (Magnificent!)

32:16.160 --> 32:16.980
- (Give me a copy too!)
- (Such talent at his age!)

32:17.030 --> 32:18.330
(What extraordinary spirit!)

32:18.620 --> 32:19.150
(Excellent writing!)

32:19.200 --> 32:19.690
(Brilliant poem!)

32:19.730 --> 32:20.190
(Beautifully written!)

32:20.240 --> 32:20.590
(Wonderful!)

32:20.640 --> 32:21.780
(Marvelous! Simply marvelous!)

32:21.830 --> 32:22.860
(What excellent writing!)

32:24.140 --> 32:24.460
Wei Shu.

32:25.330 --> 32:27.330
You don't seem to approve of his stunt.

32:29.290 --> 32:30.180
It's all a cheap trick.

32:30.490 --> 32:31.420
No gentleman would stoop to that.

32:33.460 --> 32:33.810
Yan Shang,

32:34.570 --> 32:35.050
let's go.

32:36.090 --> 32:36.420
All right.

32:40.180 --> 32:40.860
Sir, wait!

32:43.980 --> 32:45.010
Thank you for recognizing my talent

32:45.140 --> 32:46.090
and speaking up for me today.

32:46.490 --> 32:47.620
May I ask your name?

32:48.460 --> 32:49.010
My surname is Yan.

32:49.380 --> 32:49.770
I'm Yan Shang.

32:50.380 --> 32:50.730
Yan Shang,

32:51.090 --> 32:52.530
without your support today,

32:52.980 --> 32:54.730
I'd have been talking to myself!

32:55.420 --> 32:56.250
You have a gift for poetry.

32:56.730 --> 32:57.940
Whether I'd spoken up or not,

32:58.330 --> 32:59.180
someone would eventually
recognize your talent.

33:00.730 --> 33:02.180
I'm afraid by the time
someone recognizes it,

33:02.290 --> 33:03.330
I'll already be a dead man.

33:03.940 --> 33:04.770
But in any case,

33:05.220 --> 33:05.660
today,

33:06.220 --> 33:07.570
I insist on treating you
to a proper drink.

33:11.050 --> 33:13.140
Well, how could I refuse?

33:14.250 --> 33:14.700
Yan Shang.

33:15.290 --> 33:16.730
Sir, why don't you join us?

33:17.770 --> 33:18.140
No, thanks.

33:18.940 --> 33:19.420
Let's go.

33:19.770 --> 33:20.900
Go. Go.

33:24.460 --> 33:26.660
What an incredible coincidence!

33:27.860 --> 33:29.050
I study at the Imperial Academy too.

33:29.460 --> 33:31.490
But in all my time attending classes,

33:31.620 --> 33:33.050
I don't recall seeing either of you.

33:33.490 --> 33:34.900
We only enrolled today.

33:35.380 --> 33:36.290
That makes it even more remarkable!

33:36.900 --> 33:38.530
Had we met a day earlier,
we wouldn't even be classmates!

33:39.090 --> 33:39.980
What a stroke of fate!

33:40.250 --> 33:41.140
That calls for a toast!

33:50.940 --> 33:53.090
Feng Xianyu, when did you enroll
at the Imperial Academy?

33:53.900 --> 33:54.700
I'm ashamed to say,

33:55.380 --> 33:57.220
I've been studying there for five years

33:57.770 --> 33:58.860
and failed the exams every year.

33:59.980 --> 34:01.090
Otherwise,

34:01.380 --> 34:03.090
why would I resort to
such a publicity stunt?

34:06.050 --> 34:08.050
(Mu Wanyao was right.)

34:09.570 --> 34:11.650
(Sheng'an truly is full
of talented people.)

34:13.210 --> 34:14.430
(With such literary talent)

34:14.480 --> 34:15.860
(and such a flair for scheming,)

34:16.780 --> 34:18.820
(there's probably nothing
this man wouldn't do.)

34:19.010 --> 34:19.380
Have some food.

34:20.720 --> 34:26.340
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed,
it hums with the river's endless roar.)

34:26.340 --> 34:31.960
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed,
it hums with the river's endless roar.)

34:32.260 --> 34:35.260
(Xu Mianmian, Singer at Cuiyun Tower)

34:35.360 --> 34:39.440
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed,
it hums with the river's endless roar.)

34:40.650 --> 34:41.260
Come on!

34:43.740 --> 34:44.820
- Come here, Mianmian!
- Sir!

34:45.380 --> 34:45.980
(Please! Stop!)

34:46.030 --> 34:46.780
(What are you doing?)

34:47.050 --> 34:48.650
- (Let go!)
- (You're so beautiful!)

34:48.860 --> 34:50.460
(Sir, let go of me!)

34:50.650 --> 34:50.910
(Come here!)

34:50.960 --> 34:51.610
(This is outrageous!)

34:51.690 --> 34:52.300
(Sir!)

34:52.650 --> 34:53.270
(Don't be scared.)

34:53.320 --> 34:54.100
(Sir, please don't!)

34:54.150 --> 34:55.300
(Let me take you out for some fun!)

34:55.650 --> 34:56.650
(Sir, stop it!)

34:57.610 --> 34:58.260
(I don't want to!)

34:58.940 --> 34:59.580
(Sir!)

34:59.630 --> 35:00.100
(Don't run away!)

35:00.150 --> 35:01.060
(Sir, this isn't right!)

35:01.110 --> 35:02.210
- (Please let me go!)
- (Don't run!)

35:02.300 --> 35:02.780
(Come with me!)

35:02.860 --> 35:03.210
Yan Shang.

35:04.010 --> 35:04.780
Don't try to play the hero.

35:06.530 --> 35:07.690
That man's name is Zhang Renjing.

35:08.170 --> 35:10.340
He's an illiterate thug
from the Shence Army.

35:11.050 --> 35:12.010
He's killed countless people.

35:12.090 --> 35:12.460
Get lost!

35:12.530 --> 35:14.090
He earned an officer's rank
through his military exploits

35:14.610 --> 35:15.820
and was recently transferred
to Sheng'an.

35:16.260 --> 35:17.350
He's one of Lord Yu's favorites.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.140
(Please, sir! Let me go!)

35:18.190 --> 35:19.490
Everyone in the capital steers clear
of him.

35:19.570 --> 35:20.100
(I'm begging you!)

35:20.150 --> 35:20.570
(Come on!)

35:21.530 --> 35:22.050
Zhang...

35:23.940 --> 35:24.490
Ren...

35:26.340 --> 35:26.780
jing...

35:31.740 --> 35:32.740
How do you write his name?

35:32.940 --> 35:33.780
Ren, meaning "person."

35:34.650 --> 35:35.300
Jing, meaning "to quell rebellion."

35:41.860 --> 35:42.650
You've misunderstood, Feng Xianyu.

35:44.170 --> 35:45.610
I merely want to catch up

35:47.010 --> 35:47.820
with Captain Zhang.

35:49.940 --> 35:50.380
Yan Shang!

35:58.650 --> 35:59.130
Captain.

35:59.860 --> 36:00.570
It's been a long time.

36:01.010 --> 36:02.010
And you are...?

36:03.860 --> 36:05.170
You must meet so many people, Captain.

36:05.780 --> 36:06.420
Don't you remember me?

36:12.690 --> 36:14.300
You're that...

36:17.460 --> 36:18.460
My surname is Yan.

36:18.940 --> 36:19.650
I'm from Lingnan.

36:24.460 --> 36:24.980
Shang.

36:27.210 --> 36:27.820
Shang.

36:29.610 --> 36:30.690
What position do you hold?

36:30.860 --> 36:31.570
I am

36:32.260 --> 36:33.050
just a commoner.

36:33.460 --> 36:34.420
I hold no official rank or degree.

36:35.170 --> 36:36.710
Then why the hell are you

36:36.760 --> 36:37.740
acting all friendly with me?

36:38.460 --> 36:38.780
Get lost!

36:40.650 --> 36:41.010
Where is she?

36:42.340 --> 36:42.900
Where is she?

36:44.490 --> 36:44.900
Where is she?

36:45.130 --> 36:46.290
(Let's go! Hurry!)

36:46.340 --> 36:47.090
(Quick! Get out of here!)

36:47.210 --> 36:47.820
(Go! Go!)

36:50.170 --> 36:50.780
Where did she run off to?

36:51.980 --> 36:52.340
Yan Shang.

36:53.170 --> 36:53.740
Are you all right?

36:55.300 --> 36:55.610
I'm fine.

36:55.820 --> 36:56.170
Yan Shang.

36:57.050 --> 36:58.130
That man is an uncouth brute.

36:58.820 --> 36:59.860
Don't stoop to his level.

37:00.900 --> 37:01.460
But...

37:02.420 --> 37:03.420
how do you know him?

37:07.490 --> 37:08.650
I've known him for many years.

37:09.570 --> 37:10.300
He's just forgotten.

37:13.340 --> 37:14.860
We've heard poetry and enjoyed our wine.

37:15.170 --> 37:16.090
We've had our fun. Time to go.

37:16.610 --> 37:16.940
Let's go.

37:18.570 --> 37:18.900
Let's go.

37:21.570 --> 37:23.020
(Cuiyun Tower)
(Come take a look!)

37:23.070 --> 37:24.860
(Hot steamed buns!)

37:25.650 --> 37:28.170
(Freshly steamed buns!)

37:29.460 --> 37:30.650
(Come try some!)

37:32.340 --> 37:33.570
You're blocking the road!

37:33.940 --> 37:34.300
(Hurry up!)

37:34.460 --> 37:34.950
Can't you see the carriage?

37:35.000 --> 37:35.490
(Get moving!)

37:35.690 --> 37:36.300
- (Move aside!)
- (I'm talking to you!)

37:36.690 --> 37:37.370
(What are you staring at?)

37:37.420 --> 37:37.820
(Move!)

37:38.570 --> 37:40.490
So that's Grand Princess
Luling's carriage.

37:40.940 --> 37:41.570
No wonder.

37:42.420 --> 37:44.940
Do all the princesses in our dynasty
make such a grand entrance?

37:46.460 --> 37:48.260
Not all princesses are alike.

37:49.010 --> 37:49.940
I've heard of her.

37:50.210 --> 37:50.940
She's a Taoist priestess.

37:51.610 --> 37:52.490
She's supposed to have renounced
worldly pursuits.

37:52.860 --> 37:53.820
Why would she be so arrogant?

37:54.380 --> 37:56.170
Wei Shu, there's something
you don't know.

37:56.570 --> 37:59.130
Grand Princess Luling is notoriously
lustful and cruel.

37:59.650 --> 38:01.260
Widowed at a young age,
she refused to remarry,

38:01.380 --> 38:02.690
so she became a Taoist priestess
instead.

38:03.210 --> 38:05.940
I hear she keeps over a dozen
male favorites at her residence.

38:07.010 --> 38:09.090
If a favorite or servant says
one wrong word,

38:09.530 --> 38:10.570
they're often beaten to death
on the spot.

38:11.130 --> 38:13.460
Sheng'an is crawling
with powerful nobles,

38:13.980 --> 38:15.900
but she's the most tyrannical
of them all.

38:16.380 --> 38:18.010
Speaking of the most powerful person
in Sheng'an,

38:18.650 --> 38:19.690
wouldn't that be Lord Yu?

38:21.780 --> 38:23.210
Very perceptive of you.

38:24.940 --> 38:26.820
The Grand Princess can behave
so outrageously

38:27.490 --> 38:28.650
not because she belongs
to the Mu royal family.

38:29.820 --> 38:32.570
I hear she's known Lord Yu for decades,

38:33.010 --> 38:33.820
and they're very close.

38:34.380 --> 38:35.820
That's why she can throw her weight
around in Sheng'an

38:36.460 --> 38:37.130
- without fear of consequences.
- (Behave yourself!)

38:37.940 --> 38:38.420
(I'm talking to you!)

38:45.860 --> 38:47.260
What kind of incense are they burning
in that carriage?

38:47.780 --> 38:48.820
The smell is so overpowering.

38:50.210 --> 38:51.780
Wei Shu, you clearly don't know
the good stuff!

38:51.860 --> 38:53.980
That's incense specially made
for the Grand Princess.

38:54.050 --> 38:55.050
You won't find it anywhere else.

38:59.740 --> 39:00.900
(The Grand Princess's procession
is approaching!)

39:01.260 --> 39:02.340
(Carriages ahead, fall back!)

39:05.780 --> 39:06.380
(Get out of the way!)

39:07.460 --> 39:08.610
(Isn't that Princess
Danyang's carriage?)

39:09.260 --> 39:09.900
(Let's go have a look!)

39:11.490 --> 39:12.460
(How dare you come any closer!)

39:12.860 --> 39:13.260
(Move!)

39:13.860 --> 39:14.610
(You got a death wish?)

39:15.570 --> 39:16.490
(Can't you speak properly?)

39:16.860 --> 39:17.300
(How dare you!)

39:17.820 --> 39:18.420
(Get out of my way!)

39:19.170 --> 39:20.780
(Did you hear me? Move!)

39:25.340 --> 39:25.820
Aunt.

39:26.460 --> 39:27.380
It's been a long time.

39:41.650 --> 39:42.460
Danyang.

39:43.050 --> 39:44.010
My respects, Aunt.

39:47.100 --> 39:49.020
(Mu Ningshuang, Grand Princess Luling)

39:52.740 --> 39:53.210
Fall back.

39:53.820 --> 39:54.690
Let my aunt go first.

39:55.210 --> 39:56.780
(You heard her! Move back!)

39:57.420 --> 39:58.050
(Don't block the way!)

39:58.650 --> 39:59.210
(Don't block the way!)

40:00.050 --> 40:00.530
(Move!)

40:00.900 --> 40:01.340
(Move!)

40:01.900 --> 40:02.380
(Hurry up!)

40:12.090 --> 40:12.460
(Move!)

40:13.170 --> 40:13.570
(Move!)

40:13.780 --> 40:14.900
(Move aside! Fall back!)

40:15.690 --> 40:16.010
(Back!)

40:16.210 --> 40:16.570
(Back!)

40:16.980 --> 40:17.300
(Back!)

40:27.090 --> 40:28.130
Safe travels, Aunt.

40:45.020 --> 40:49.960
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing
across your brow♪

40:52.310 --> 40:57.120
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

40:57.700 --> 41:00.060
♪Together we'll soar to the skies♪

41:01.460 --> 41:01.900
Your Highness.

41:02.050 --> 41:03.550
♪Burning bright as a song♪

41:05.380 --> 41:05.740
Your Highness.

41:07.620 --> 41:12.130
♪Be the promise I hold deep in my heart♪

41:14.010 --> 41:14.490
Shu.

41:15.900 --> 41:17.930
Did your enrollment go smoothly?

41:17.980 --> 41:19.590
♪Not a single hour less♪

41:20.570 --> 41:21.170
Yes, Your Highness.

41:21.980 --> 41:23.780
I enrolled at the Imperial Academy
today.

41:26.940 --> 41:29.130
Did anyone give you trouble there?

41:30.380 --> 41:30.820
No.

41:31.690 --> 41:33.050
In fact, I made two new friends.

41:34.010 --> 41:34.780
This is Feng...

41:37.260 --> 41:38.610
This isn't the place to talk.

41:39.090 --> 41:40.860
Come see me at my residence tonight.

41:41.390 --> 41:43.150
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock in dusk♪

41:43.200 --> 41:43.830
♪May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, and seasons turn♪

41:44.740 --> 41:45.090
Let's go.

41:46.160 --> 41:48.310
♪You're the only one I need♪

41:48.640 --> 41:55.630
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

41:55.780 --> 41:57.600
♪Be my one and only in this world♪

41:58.000 --> 41:58.950
♪Be my one and only in this life♪

41:59.500 --> 42:01.560
♪My last untouched innocence♪

42:02.570 --> 42:03.130
Yan Shang.

42:03.490 --> 42:05.900
Why did the princess seem
to ignore you just now?

42:13.530 --> 42:14.610
Wei Shu. Yan Shang.

42:14.980 --> 42:16.860
You both know Princess Danyang?

42:36.650 --> 42:37.050
What's wrong?

42:37.940 --> 42:38.460
Yan Shang,

42:39.420 --> 42:41.780
the princess asked me to visit
her residence tonight.

42:42.340 --> 42:43.380
Was she serious,

42:43.820 --> 42:44.820
or was she just teasing me?

42:45.610 --> 42:46.740
Whether she was joking or not,

42:47.420 --> 42:48.050
you should go.

42:50.940 --> 42:52.300
Matters of the heart

42:53.170 --> 42:55.460
really are more complicated
than alchemy.

42:57.610 --> 42:58.010
(Hey, you over there!)

42:58.530 --> 42:59.900
(We're one player short for foot polo!)

43:00.170 --> 43:00.530
(Want to join?)

43:01.940 --> 43:02.900
We'll pass.

43:03.300 --> 43:04.340
I don't know how to play anyway.

43:04.860 --> 43:05.570
Neither do I.

43:10.050 --> 43:11.010
I've never played foot polo.

43:11.490 --> 43:12.090
Can I still join?

43:12.650 --> 43:13.140
Of course!

43:13.190 --> 43:13.620
(We can teach you!)

43:13.670 --> 43:14.530
(Sure! No problem!)

43:14.650 --> 43:15.020
(Come on! Let's go!)

43:15.070 --> 43:15.710
(We'll teach you! Come on!)

43:15.760 --> 43:16.060
(Let's go!)

43:16.110 --> 43:17.120
(Just come along!)

43:17.170 --> 43:17.530
(Come on!)

43:20.130 --> 43:21.420
Yan Shang is so easygoing.

43:22.610 --> 43:23.460
Someone like him

43:24.300 --> 43:25.610
must be well-liked by everyone.

43:27.530 --> 43:28.780
Wei Shu, may I have a word in private?

43:32.860 --> 43:34.340
I have a rather presumptuous favor

43:34.690 --> 43:35.780
to ask of you.

43:36.090 --> 43:37.130
Go ahead.

43:42.210 --> 43:44.130
Could you introduce me
to Princess Danyang?

43:49.980 --> 43:50.910
(Imperial Academy)
(What a magnificent carriage!)

43:50.960 --> 43:51.820
(And look at those horses!)

43:52.170 --> 43:53.300
(They're so strong and magnificent!)

43:53.530 --> 43:54.570
(I feel like I've seen them
somewhere before.)

43:55.650 --> 43:56.940
(Isn't that the princess's carriage?)

43:57.090 --> 43:57.570
(That's right!)

43:58.530 --> 43:59.610
(Who's it here to pick up?)

43:59.780 --> 44:00.690
(Don't you recognize
that carriage roof?)

44:00.860 --> 44:01.490
(No idea!)

44:01.690 --> 44:02.260
(No way!)

44:02.690 --> 44:03.750
(Princess Danyang's carriage?)

44:03.800 --> 44:04.730
(Why is it parked outside our door?)

44:04.780 --> 44:05.140
(Exactly!)

44:05.190 --> 44:06.020
(It looks like an empress's carriage!)

44:06.070 --> 44:06.950
(Could it be here to pick up...)

44:07.000 --> 44:07.350
(Possibly!)

44:07.400 --> 44:08.130
(It really is the princess!)

44:08.300 --> 44:08.950
(How could that be?)

44:09.000 --> 44:09.500
(Don't talk nonsense!)

44:09.550 --> 44:10.490
(The princess's carriage is here
in person!)

44:10.650 --> 44:11.500
- Excuse me.
- (The princess's carriage...)

44:11.550 --> 44:12.460
(Why would it pick up one of us?)

44:12.690 --> 44:13.210
Sir.

44:13.610 --> 44:13.940
This way, please.

44:14.090 --> 44:15.380
(Could it be here for him?)

44:16.130 --> 44:16.980
- (Nonsense!)
- (Why is he getting in?)

44:17.380 --> 44:18.170
(I'd already heard about it!)

44:18.740 --> 44:20.170
(Wei Shu has close ties
to the princess's residence.)

44:21.980 --> 44:22.690
(So the rumors are true!)

44:23.190 --> 44:23.540
(Oh, my!)

44:23.590 --> 44:24.610
(I'd already heard about it.)

44:25.050 --> 44:26.260
(He's Princess Danyang's...)

44:26.570 --> 44:27.460
(It's true! It really is!)

44:28.240 --> 44:28.540
(Oh, dear!)

44:28.590 --> 44:29.940
(That's no way for a scholar
to get ahead!)

44:40.580 --> 44:44.580
(Next Episode Preview)

44:46.420 --> 44:47.420
Yan Shang, come on! Hurry!

44:51.090 --> 44:51.860
I'll make a sacrifice

44:53.650 --> 44:54.170
and marry you.

44:54.420 --> 44:55.820
Your Highness, look who's here!

45:01.360 --> 45:04.653
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:07.338 --> 45:12.254
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:14.448 --> 45:20.293
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:20.793 --> 45:26.019
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

45:28.788 --> 45:33.579
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

45:34.415 --> 45:40.494
♪Through trails of mud and blood;
let grief drown in your eyes♪

45:42.295 --> 45:45.445
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

45:45.445 --> 45:47.093
♪Burning bright as a song♪

45:47.145 --> 45:50.869
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

45:51.247 --> 45:55.913
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

45:56.532 --> 46:00.573
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:01.064 --> 46:03.179
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:03.219 --> 46:10.165
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

46:10.928 --> 46:14.381
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:14.561 --> 46:17.706
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:18.145 --> 46:24.782
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

46:25.179 --> 46:29.693
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:29.731 --> 46:32.200
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:32.404 --> 46:39.291
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:39.603 --> 46:42.874
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

46:43.179 --> 46:46.352
♪My last untouched innocence♪

46:46.676 --> 46:50.102
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

46:50.335 --> 46:53.560
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

46:53.891 --> 47:00.687
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:01.056 --> 47:05.622
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:05.669 --> 47:08.007
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:08.238 --> 47:15.073
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:15.422 --> 47:17.040
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:17.170 --> 47:18.966
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:19.323 --> 47:22.340
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:22.380 --> 47:23.707
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
